      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "友達は私に花束、香水のびん、大きなケーキを贈ってくれました。",
      "text_en": "My friends gave me a bouquet of flowers, a bottle of perfume, and a big cake, which I loved very much.",
